      "id": "hv-1",
      "conflict": "The primary framework for managing systemic AI externalities.",
      "prevails": "Sentinel",
      "criterion": "logical_validity",
      "rationale": "Sentinel correctly identifies that market-based liability fails when the potential damages of an existential-scale event exceed a firm's total assets. Because private entities cannot hold infinite insurance, relying on traditional liability for systemic risks creates an unbridgeable insolvency gap.",
